5) DETAILED ARCHITECTURE THINKING
==============================================================================

HIGH LEVEL COMPONENTS
- API Gateway
- Order Service
- Transaction Coordinator
- Payment DB
- Inventory DB
- Order DB
- WAL / durable logs
- Retry subsystem
- Timeout detector
- Monitoring + alerts

REQUEST FLOW
Client → Order Service
      → Coordinator creates txn_id
      → send prepare to payment/inventory/order
      → collect votes
      → persist decision
      → broadcast final decision
      → ack client

WHY txn_id IMPORTANT
Needed for:
- idempotency
- dedup
- retries
- recovery
- debugging
- tracing

Production best practice:
Globally unique transaction IDs.

