11) REAL WORLD COMPANY SYSTEMS
==============================================================================

AMAZON
- payment + inventory + order
- often avoid global 2PC in large microservices
- use reservation + saga hybrid

WHATSAPP
- not for message fanout path
- too latency sensitive
- use async replication + retries

INSTAGRAM
- post write path often async fanout
- no need strict 2PC

PAYMENT LEDGERS
- excellent 2PC candidate
- money correctness critical

GOOGLE SPANNER
- 2PC over Paxos groups
- globally consistent SQL

Golden interview line:
2PC is common in strongly consistent financial/ledger workflows, but less common in internet-scale latency-sensitive product paths.

