14) EDGE CASES + PRODUCTION GOTCHAS
==============================================================================

- duplicate prepare requests
- duplicate commit retries
- participant commit ACK lost
- stale coordinator retry after failover
- transaction timeout after user disconnect
- deadlock during prepare
- prepared row lock causes hotspot
- poison transaction repeatedly failing
- region clock skew affecting timeouts
- retry storm after partial outage

Mitigations:
- idempotency keys
- exponential backoff
- dedup table
- circuit breakers
- coordinator fencing tokens
- bounded retry budget

==============================================================================
15) QUICK REVISION BULLETS
==============================================================================

- 2PC = atomic commit across distributed nodes
- phase 1 = prepare/vote
- phase 2 = commit/abort
- coordinator decides
- participant logs before YES
- blocking if coordinator crashes after YES
- consistency over availability during partition
- expensive across regions
- bad for long workflows
- great for payment/ledger correctness
- saga preferred for business workflows

